	(text "SA0 = GND → address 0x6A (0x6B is used by the BQ25798). CS = VDDIO → I2C mode.\nINT1 push-pull, active high → expander input (P04). SDx/SCx (auxiliary I2C) to GND.\nLSM6DSOX: same footprint and pinout as the LSM6DSO (enough stock at LCSC)."
