	(text "Standard 3-pin servo plug (GND, +5 V, signal; e.g. SG90/MG90S for head tilt).\n+5 V comes from the Pi rail: the servo only moves while the Pi is on. C609 buffers the\nservo current peaks. R604 keeps the signal low while the ESP32 boots (no twitch). J603 not fitted by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.74 93.98 0)
		(effects
